                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Vahdam's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Premium direct-from-source Indian tea + international-first strategy + Amazon international dominance + wellness-adjacent positioning. Multi-dimensional international D2C advantage.</p>
                                        <h3>Can other Indian tea brands compete internationally?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in specific niching (single-estate specialty, specific tea variety focus, sustainability-focused, wellness-specific). Category continues expanding.</p>
                                        <h3>Is Amazon international worth for Indian brands?</h3>
                                        <p>For premium India-origin categories: yes. Requires Amazon expertise + FBA international + inventory + logistics investment.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest India-origin international lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Direct-from-source + supply chain transparency + wellness-adjacent + international marketplace combined. Not simple to replicate but path proven.</p>
